---
description: Never invent or set user account passwords in agent/test flows
alwaysApply: true
---

# No agent-set user passwords

- Never invent, generate, or set a ListJetGo user password (including test/demo/default passwords).
- Never call `setInitialPasswordForUser`, `/auth/password/set`, `/auth/password/change`, or `/auth/password/reset` on behalf of a real user unless the user explicitly provides the password in the chat for that one action.
- Never write plaintext passwords to logs, API responses, commits, or agent reports.
- Users set passwords only via product UI: register, Google password-setup modal, Settings “Şifre Değiştir”, or forgot/reset flow.
